
Low-Latency-Ops / 查已有平台
===== 查已有平台 =====
先核对进程与文件，再判断是否需要升级 A/B。
$ bash /financial-low-latency/apps/flle-trading-lab/scripts/transport_labctl.sh verify 20260917T020441Z-02-trading-platform --allow-legacy-market
完整输出：/financial-low-latency/Documents/reports/course-runs/20260917T020441Z-02-trading-platform/raw/reuse-20260917T091033.399827029Z.txt
命令失败，退出码 127；以下为日志末尾。
$ tail -n 20 /financial-low-latency/Documents/reports/course-runs/20260917T020441Z-02-trading-platform/raw/reuse-20260917T091033.399827029Z.txt
bash: /var/tmp/flle-trading-lab-20260917T020441Z-02-trading-platform/control/apps/flle-trading-lab/scripts/transport_labctl.sh: No such file or directory

